Package: buRst
Type: Package
Title: Inferring transcriptional bursting dynamics from single-cell metabolic RNA-labeling data
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Teresa", "Rummel", email = "teresa.rummel@ur.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Florian", "Erhard", email = "Florian.Erhard@informatik.uni-regensburg.de", role = c("aut"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3574-6983"))
    )
Description: Likelihood-based inference of transcriptional burst frequency,
    burst size and RNA degradation rates from single-cell RNA sequencing
    with metabolic RNA labeling. Combines per-cell labeling likelihoods
    with mechanistic RNA count distributions to account for uncertainty
    in newly synthesized RNA measurements. Supports steady-state and
    transient models, simulation of RNA counts and labeling evidence,
    and posterior-based comparisons of kinetic changes between conditions.
URL: https://burst.erhard-lab.de/, https://github.com/erhard-lab/buRst
BugReports: https://github.com/erhard-lab/buRst/issues
